Chapter: InsertAtGrowRt

 Fifty thousand insertions ask a one-slot growth policy for about 10 GB, past
 a 32-bit address space, and a doubling one for under a megabyte; thirty
 thousand asked for 3.6 GB, which the host granted, and measured nothing.

  build-list : List Integer, Integer, Integer -> List Integer
  build-list (acc) (i) (n) =
   if i == n then acc
   else build-list (list-insert-at acc (list-length acc) i) (i + 1) n

  grown : Integer -> Integer
  grown (n) =
   let l = build-list [] 0 n
   in list-length l + list-at l (n - 1)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni (show (grown 50000))
  end
